# Example Tall Tower — Midtown Manhattan
# Simple box massing: ~84m E-W x 111m N-S x 244m tall (~800ft)
# Centered at origin. Z-up, meters. +Y = north.
# When loaded in shadow_tier3_obj: set model_rotation_deg=29 for Manhattan grid alignment.
#
# Footprint: matches example_building_tall.geojson (Manhattan-grid-aligned)
# Height: 244m (800ft)

# Ground corners (z=0)
v -42.0 -55.5  0.0
v  42.0 -55.5  0.0
v  42.0  55.5  0.0
v -42.0  55.5  0.0

# Roof corners (z=244m)
v -42.0 -55.5 243.84
v  42.0 -55.5 243.84
v  42.0  55.5 243.84
v -42.0  55.5 243.84

# Faces (each face = 1 wall or slab)
# Bottom
f 1 2 3 4
# Top
f 8 7 6 5
# South wall
f 1 2 6 5
# East wall
f 2 3 7 6
# North wall
f 3 4 8 7
# West wall
f 4 1 5 8
